## What I did

Being one of the top leaders in the Game & Attraction Industry, Triotech was looking to adapt their web image to the Chinese audience.

The previous version relied heavily on large animations and resource-intensive elements that negatively impacted loading speed and usability. The redesign prioritised lighter assets, simplified interactions, and improved mobile responsiveness to ensure faster load times and a more stable browsing experience.

At the same time, the site maintains a playful and engaging feel through subtle 3D hover animations and SVG morphing techniques, adding moments of delight without compromising performance. The result is a streamlined website that allows users to explore attractions and innovations more efficiently, tailored to the technical realities of the Chinese market.

